{"parse": {"title": "雏鸟为何坠落-02", "pageid": 141885, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9B%8F%E9%B8%9F%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E5%9D%A0%E8%90%BD-01\" title=\"雏鸟为何坠落-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">雏鸟为何坠落-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9B%8F%E9%B8%9F%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E5%9D%A0%E8%90%BD-03\" title=\"雏鸟为何坠落-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">雏鸟为何坠落</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9C.8B.E5.8F.8B.E5.86.8D.E8.A7.81\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"朋友再见\">朋友再见</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 朋友再见</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Until We Meet Again</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_03\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Cg-3_8_bg_03.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Cg-3_8_bg_03.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Cg-3_8_bg_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……我不记得这里有类似的“鬼魂”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她想起了奠基石的疑问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>但或许……我的记性也不是太好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>那毕竟是很久之前的事情了……我想，可能有几十年了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>都过去那么久了，你为什么现在才来找那个人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>喔……最近有一些……私人原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>总之，那是我表姐，死的时候大约13岁吧，据说就是在这栋建筑里失足坠落的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>她叫卢齐安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>表姐，女性。不是奠基石所描述的病弱的男孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>原来……这是个常见的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>喔，这其实是个男孩的名字，用给女孩会很奇怪——不过我舅舅喜欢标新立异。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>我偷偷看过她的照片。她的发型和你很像，一头长长的辫子，穿着裙子——这也是常见的诺瓦米奇装束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>不过，她的头发是黑色的，眼睛是蓝色的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“鬼魂”们仍旧在远远地游荡，一种若有若无的在意漫上了回声谣的心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……就像纸上洇开的墨点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>这里的“鬼魂”都是我的朋友，我们可以知道彼此的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>虽然……我之前已经寻找过另一个名为卢齐安的“鬼魂”……但那次我只问了男孩们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>如果你很想找到这个卢齐安……我可以再问问大家，再看看大家的样貌……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>回声谣，我们干嘛管她的事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>噢……我想，或许这就是奠基石女士所说的……“适应有人的环境”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祖赞娜的眼中闪出了诡异的光。她猛地拍了下大腿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>等等，我想起来了！我听说过你，你是那位被基金会邀请入职的“鬼魂”大师！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>小道消息说你会暂时住在办事处……如果有房间的话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>大师？我不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>职员弹跳起来，上前握住她透明质地的右手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>麻烦您，大师！我有非见她不可的理由！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>喂——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣闭上眼，“鬼魂”们的思绪仍在她的脑海中飘浮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“鬼魂”们沉默着。它们在建筑的回声中诞生，如今也依然固守着自己的名字、过往和记忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她与所有的“鬼魂”对视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在一瞬间知道了许多人的名字：奥列格、艾玛、安娜、莱娜……这些名字里的确没有卢齐安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣睁开了眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>没有……这里没有这样的“鬼魂”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>都没有。没有黑辫子的女孩，没有在建筑中失足坠落的女孩，没有叫作卢齐安的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>……你确定吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>“鬼魂”大师没必要骗你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祖赞娜松开了回声谣的手，眼睛里的光也黯淡下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过了半晌，她勉强开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>好吧。我想……或许我是太异想天开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>仔细想想，原本就没有任何证据表明她变成了“鬼魂”……只是，我也没有别的办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>我只是希望她确实在这里……落空也是正常的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祖赞娜变得有些语无伦次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>谢谢你，大师……轮班的时间到了，我该走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她心不在焉地退了几步，挥了挥手便转身离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到脚步声消失在走廊尽头，小洪扎才想起了一件惊天大事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>我们忘了告诉她我们的名字！！！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_18.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_18\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_18\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-3_8_bg_18.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-3_8_bg_18.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_18.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-3_8_bg_18.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_18.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>但我们总有再见的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉的背影正站在墙根下，用锤凿敲打灰白色的石块。祖赞娜并未留意身后轻微的声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我是回声谣，所有的朋友都会再度重逢～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>她不是朋友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祖赞娜的身子一抖，缓缓转过身，露出一个尴尬的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>哦！几天不见！大师——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>你这小偷！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小洪扎以斗牛般的速度直撞上她的脑门。祖赞娜捂着脑袋蹲下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>我可以解释！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>大师，你绝对想不到，这里有一种特殊的石头，可以记录建筑内的声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>虽然项目的具体内容属于机密，但基金会甚至用这种石头重建了穹顶——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>是的，它们是回声石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祖赞娜惊讶地看了看她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>你知道？我还找了好多人打听，你怎么……算了，我也没问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>总之……我认为回声石可能记录了一些表姐的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>他们过去经常在这里野餐……而且，她的坠亡在当时引起了一些骚动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>可是……大部分回声石都是组成穹顶的材料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>嘿！我还没疯到去毁坏穹顶。我只是听说，这里还留了一些未用于穹顶建造的残次品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她指了指身后那些破损的混凝土块。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>它们可能不适合作为建筑材料，但是……应该仍然保存着声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>我刚刚的确听到了一些模糊的杂音！我只是想试试！我检查完毕之后就会还回来，我保证！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣飘到回声石前，抚上那些泛着青色光泽的灰白面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她感到一阵熟悉——就像她已经这样做过无数次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轻语声开始侵入脑海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我能听到大家留下的声音……所有人的声音……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>不用把它敲下来带走。我可以帮你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>回声谣！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小洪扎不满地嘟囔着，而祖赞娜看她的眼神已接近崇拜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>天啊，大师，这——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>可是……我有个要求……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>“鬼魂”们……原本平静地生活在这里，你的闯入……让大家觉得不安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我想请你之后不要再打扰大家的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>……抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>我已经不是喜欢找存在感的青少年了。这件事过后，我不会再踏入你们的家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣点了点头。回声石在她的手中轻颤。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_21\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-3_8_bg_21.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-3_8_bg_21.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-3_8_bg_21.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"3840\" data-file-height=\"2160\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一片无边无际的光海出现在回声谣的视野中，她闭上眼睛，又一次让自己沉入其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自我的边界逐渐消融。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她触摸到了一首歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>你是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">歌：</div><div>你是一首歌。<br />他们在圣诞夜的战场上歌唱你。<br />有个男孩把你记在笔记本上，打算回乡后送给心爱的姑娘。<br />大家在他的葬礼上唱了你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后是一支笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笔：</div><div>你是一支笔。<br />穿着毛绒格子的作家曾用你奋笔疾书。<br />最后，他手握酒瓶，醉倒在了古老的穹顶下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后是一只猫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫：</div><div>你是一只猫。<br />诺维茨卡家的小女儿最喜欢你，你最喜欢用深蓝色的毛皮沙发磨爪子。<br />后来他们拖着行李箱离开了这里，你跳出窗户，跑到了建筑内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>这些是……记忆？是……我的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她隐约知道这些——她如何作为歌谣诞生，如何旁观着来来往往的人们……可是之后所有的细节都十分模糊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>不要这些，要一个女孩……长辫子，黑头发……与这位祖赞娜相关。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>记忆流光般从她身旁飞逝，飞到五年前……十年前……二十年前。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_14\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>大家都丢这里，这里没人管！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一车垃圾被无情地倾倒在了建筑角落，遍地的破纸袋和碎玻璃迎来了新的同伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个小木偶抖抖脑袋，从垃圾堆中探出头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-654102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-654102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-654102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我是……回声谣？</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "雏鸟为何坠落-02"}}